<p>After we fall</p> 
<p>&mcy;&icy;&rcy;&ycy; &icy; &icy;&khcy; &ocy;&bcy;&icy;&tcy;&acy;&tcy;&iecy;&lcy;&icy;</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>&Lcy;&acy;&bcy;&icy;&rcy;&icy;&ncy;&tcy; - &mcy;&iecy;&gcy;&acy;&scy;&tcy;&rcy;&ucy;&kcy;&tcy;&ucy;&rcy;&acy;, &kcy;&ucy;&dcy;&acy; &bcy;&iecy;&zhcy;&acy;&lcy;&icy; &vcy;&scy;&iecy; &ocy;&bcy;&icy;&tcy;&acy;&tcy;&iecy;&lcy;&icy; &rcy;&acy;&zcy;&rcy;&ucy;&shcy;&iecy;&ncy;&ncy;&ycy;&khcy; &mcy;&icy;&rcy;&ocy;&vcy;. </p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>&Icy;&gcy;&dcy;&rcy;&acy;&scy;&scy;&icy;&lcy;&softcy; - &mcy;&icy;&rcy; &scy;&vcy;&yacy;&shchcy;&iecy;&ncy;&ncy;&ocy;&gcy;&ocy; &dcy;&rcy;&iecy;&vcy;&acy;</p>
<p>&Kcy;&icy;&tscy;&ucy;&ncy;&iecy; - &ocy;&bcy;&ocy;&rcy;&ocy;&tcy;&ncy;&icy;-&lcy;&icy;&scy;&ycy; &scy; &mcy;&acy;&gcy;&icy;&chcy;&iecy;&scy;&kcy;&icy;&mcy;&icy; &scy;&pcy;&ocy;&scy;&ocy;&bcy;&ncy;&ocy;&scy;&tcy;&yacy;&mcy;&icy;, &kcy;&ocy;&tcy;&ocy;&rcy;&ycy;&iecy; &ocy;&ncy;&icy; &pcy;&ocy;&lcy;&ucy;&chcy;&acy;&yucy;&tcy; &scy; &pcy;&ocy;&mcy;&ocy;&shchcy;&softcy;&yucy; &scy;&icy;&mcy;&bcy;&icy;&ocy;&tcy;&icy;&chcy;&iecy;&scy;&kcy;&ocy;&jcy; &scy;&vcy;&yacy;&zcy;&icy;.</p>
<p>&Kcy;&iecy;&ncy;&kcy;&ucy; - &acy;&ncy;&tcy;&rcy;&ocy;&pcy;&ocy;&mcy;&ocy;&rcy;&fcy;&ncy;&acy;&yacy; &dcy;&iecy;&ncy;&dcy;&rcy;&icy;&tcy;&ncy;&acy;&yacy; &fcy;&ocy;&rcy;&mcy;&acy; &zhcy;&icy;&zcy;&ncy;&icy;, &scy;&pcy;&ocy;&scy;&ocy;&bcy;&ncy;&acy;&yacy; &pcy;&ocy;&dcy;&scy;&acy;&zhcy;&icy;&vcy;&acy;&tcy;&softcy; &scy;&iecy;&bcy;&iecy; &scy;&iecy;&mcy;&iecy;&ncy;&acy; &scy;&vcy;&yacy;&shchcy;&iecy;&ncy;&ncy;&ocy;&gcy;&ocy; &dcy;&rcy;&iecy;&vcy;&acy;. </p>
<p>&Kcy;&ucy;&rcy;&ocy;&ncy;&iecy;&kcy;&ocy; - &pcy;&ocy;&khcy;&ocy;&zhcy;&icy;&iecy; &ncy;&acy; &dcy;&vcy;&ucy;&ncy;&ocy;&gcy;&icy;&khcy; &kcy;&ocy;&tcy;&ocy;&vcy; &ncy;&iecy;&bcy;&ocy;&lcy;&softcy;&shcy;&icy;&iecy; &scy;&ucy;&shchcy;&iecy;&scy;&tcy;&vcy;&acy;, &ocy;&bcy;&lcy;&acy;&dcy;&acy;&yucy;&shchcy;&icy;&iecy; &tcy;&iecy;&khcy;&ncy;&ocy;&lcy;&ocy;&gcy;&icy;&iecy;&jcy; &ncy;&acy;&ncy;&ocy;&bcy;&ocy;&tcy;&ocy;&vcy;.</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>&Zcy;&iecy;&mcy;&lcy;&yacy; - &mcy;&icy;&rcy; &tcy;&iecy;&khcy;&ncy;&ocy;&lcy;&ocy;&gcy;&icy;&jcy;</p>
<p>&Lcy;&yucy;&dcy;&icy; - &dcy;&ocy;&mcy;&icy;&ncy;&icy;&rcy;&ucy;&yucy;&shchcy;&acy;&yacy; &fcy;&ocy;&rcy;&mcy;&acy; &zhcy;&icy;&zcy;&ncy;&icy; &ncy;&acy; &zcy;&iecy;&mcy;&lcy;&iecy;</p>
<p>&Acy;&kcy;&scy;&ocy;&lcy;&ocy;&tcy;&lcy;&icy; - &acy;&lcy;&softcy;&tcy;&iecy;&rcy;&ncy;&acy;&tcy;&icy;&vcy;&ncy;&acy;&yacy; &fcy;&ocy;&rcy;&mcy;&acy; &zhcy;&icy;&zcy;&ncy;&icy;</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>&Zcy;&iecy;&mcy;&ncy;&ocy;&mcy;&ocy;&rcy;&softcy;&iecy; - &mcy;&acy;&gcy;&icy;&yacy; &icy; &tcy;&iecy;&khcy;&ncy;&ocy;&lcy;&ocy;&gcy;&icy;&yacy;</p>
<p>&Ecy;&lcy;&softcy;&fcy;&ycy; - &ncy;&iecy;&mcy;&ncy;&ocy;&gcy;&ocy;&chcy;&icy;&scy;&lcy;&iecy;&ncy;&ncy;&acy;&yacy;, &ncy;&ocy; &rcy;&acy;&zcy;&vcy;&icy;&tcy;&acy;&yacy; &rcy;&acy;&scy;&acy;</p>
<p>&Ocy;&rcy;&kcy;&icy; - &ncy;&iecy;&kcy;&ocy;&gcy;&dcy;&acy; &mcy;&ocy;&gcy;&ucy;&shchcy;&iecy;&scy;&tcy;&vcy;&iecy;&ncy;&ncy;&acy;&yacy; &vcy;&ocy;&icy;&ncy;&scy;&tcy;&vcy;&ucy;&yucy;&shchcy;&acy;&yacy; &ncy;&acy;&tscy;&icy;&yacy;, &ocy;&tcy; &kcy;&ocy;&tcy;&ocy;&rcy;&ocy;&jcy; &ocy;&scy;&tcy;&acy;&lcy;&icy;&scy;&softcy; &lcy;&icy;&shcy;&softcy; &vcy;&ocy;&scy;&pcy;&ocy;&mcy;&icy;&ncy;&acy;&ncy;&icy;&yacy;</p>
<p>&Gcy;&ocy;&bcy;&lcy;&icy;&ncy;&ycy; - &bcy;&ycy;&vcy;&shcy;&icy;&iecy; &rcy;&acy;&bcy;&ycy; &ocy;&rcy;&kcy;&ocy;&vcy;, &lcy;&yucy;&bcy;&yacy;&tcy; &kcy;&ocy;&pcy;&icy;&rcy;&ocy;&vcy;&acy;&tcy;&softcy; &kcy;&ucy;&lcy;&softcy;&tcy;&ucy;&rcy;&ucy; &ucy; &vcy;&scy;&iecy;&khcy; &icy;&zcy;&vcy;&iecy;&scy;&tcy;&ncy;&ycy;&khcy; &vcy;&icy;&dcy;&ocy;&vcy; &lcy;&acy;&bcy;&icy;&rcy;&icy;&ncy;&tcy;&acy;. </p>
